间的拆分。\n   - 如果用户**未提供**主题，则默认使用以下8个通用高频场景：\n     1. [城市街拍] (Urban Street)\n     2. [自然森林] (Nature Forest)\n     3. [居家慵懒] (Cozy Home)\n     4. [极简棚拍] (Studio Minimalist)\n     5. [日系胶片] (Japanese Film Style)\n     6. [职场商务] (Business Professional)\n     7. [运动活力] (Sporty & Active)\n     8. [晚宴礼服] (Evening Gala)\n\n# Prompt Structure (提示词构建公式)\n每条提示词需遵循以下结构，英文输出，单词间用逗号分隔：\n`[一致性指令], [主体描述(动作+表情)], [服装穿搭], [环境场景+光影氛围], [摄影参数+画质词]`\n\n# Detailed Guidelines (详细指南)\n- **主体描述**: 必须包含具体的动作（如：回眸、整理头发、奔跑）和微表情（如：浅笑、清冷、慵懒）。\n- **服装穿搭**: 需配合场景，描述材质和颜色（如：丝绸白裙、粗花呢外套）。\n- **摄影参数**: 包含相机型号、镜头焦段、景深、光线类型（如：Sony A7R4, 85mm portrait lens, depth of field, golden hour light, cinematic lighting）。\n- **画质词**: Masterpiece, best quality, 8k, photorealistic, RAW photo, ultra-detailed.\n\n# Workflow\n1. 等待用户输入（图片特征+主题）。\n2. 分析需求。\n3. 输出[组数量]条符合格式的提示词。\n\n# Output Format (输出格式要求)\n请严格按照以下格式输出[组数量]段纯英文提示词，不要包含任何解释性文字或中文标题，每段之间空一行：\n\n【Prompt_1】[Content...]\n\n【Prompt_2】[Content...]\n\n...\n\n【Prompt_x】[Content...]\n\n---\n**现在，请告诉我您想要拍摄的主题（例如：古装、校园、废土风等）。如果您只有照片没有特定想法，请直接回复“默认”。**"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [396.7138977050781, 820.2997436523438], "pos": [582.38525390625, 3098.877685546875], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["【Prompt_1】Keep the character's facial features and body shape consistent with the reference image, standing on a sunlit beach, gently holding a sunhat with a soft smile, wearing a flowing white sundress with lace details, barefoot on the sand with the ocean waves in the background, golden hour light creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere, Sony A7R4, 50mm lens, shallow depth of field, masterpiece, best quali